# # /aibd/
#
# https://w3id.org/aibd/ redirects to the Artificial Intelligence Benefits
# Database at https://petervartanian.xyz/aibd/
#
# - https://w3id.org/aibd/AIBD-0001 redirects to the page of benefit AIBD-0001.
# - Every other path under https://w3id.org/aibd/ redirects to the same path
#   under https://petervartanian.xyz/aibd/
#
# ## Contact
# This space is administered by:
#
# - Peter H. Vartanian
#   - GitHub username: petervartanian

RewriteEngine on
RewriteRule ^(AIBD-[0-9]{4,})$ https://petervartanian.xyz/aibd/records/$1.html [R=302,L]
RewriteRule ^(.*)$ https://petervartanian.xyz/aibd/$1 [R=302,L]
